ing GCP customer it's really simple  to onboard enterprise identity using  Google's ID as a service what makes it  Google a compelling cloud identity  provider is the robust and secure  infrastructure that backs the service  based on our experience running seven  services with a monthly active users  account of  a billion users we apply advanced  machine learning techniques to identify  threats and design and build custom  hardened systems from hardware to  networks to software this is the same  infrastructure that supports Google  businesses while we don't support legacy  protocols we do work with trusted  partners like octa and ping to enable an  end-to-end solution for our customers  that spans cloud and hybrid use cases  use Google's cloud identity and  Directory as your master source to get  the benefits of Google's infrastructure  and use a recommended partner to help  bridge between cloud and on-premise in  all cases keeping your trust is  paramount your data is always yours and  Google will never use your data for ads  cloud identity meets compliance and  regulatory needs including various  certifications and we publicly document  security best practices including  employee background checks independent  audit processes and more to see demos on  how to onboard identities to GCP using  ID as a service and how Netflix has used  Google identity help power their  business check out the full session  video on YouTube and if you want more  recaps on great next content make sure  to check out the rest of our playlist  and don't forget the next world tour  coming soon to a city near you  [Music]
 

